Yes. Here is an example :

 raw <- ReadAffy()
 ps  <- probeset(raw, 
                 genenames=c("203508_at","204563_at", "204513_s_at"))

Now you can use either lapply or sapply.

 pms1 <- lapply( ps, pm )
 pms2 <- sapply( ps, pm )

Now 'pms1' will be a list while 'pms2' would be a matrix.

Regards, Adai



