Subject: [BioC] combine pm and oligo sequence information
In-Reply-To: <16A0583FB1644E4DB8C0A0265028B6FD06798CC3@nihexchange13.nih.gov>
References: <16A0583FB1644E4DB8C0A0265028B6FD06798CC3@nihexchange13.nih.gov>
